OL,3,GNEWSAJustice minister says executive
OL,4,Amust 'accept the reality' over budget
OL,5,Aoffer
OL,6,
OL,7,FThe Northern Ireland Executive needs to
OL,8,F"accept the reality" that there is no
OL,9,Fmore money on offer from the UK
OL,10,Fgovernment to help stabilise Northern
OL,11,FIreland's finances, Alliance Party
OL,12,Fleader Naomi Long has said.
OL,14,FLong, who is also justice minister, was
OL,15,Fspeaking ahead of an urgent executive
OL,16,Fmeeting on the negotiations.
OL,18,FNo budget has been agreed by the
OL,19,Fpower-sharing coalition six months into
OL,20,Fthe financial year, with Stormont
OL,21,Fparties pressing Westminster for more
OL,22,Ffunding.
OL,23,APub: 06-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageB NI NewsC Reg TVF On This Day
FL,414,410,260,120,0,100
