OL,3,GNEWSAJustice minister says executive
OL,4,Amust 'accept the reality' over budget
OL,5,Aoffer
OL,6,
OL,7,FNorthern Ireland Secretary Sir Chris
OL,8,FBryant last week instructed his
OL,9,Fofficials to consider "contingency
OL,10,Fplans" after a deadline passed for
OL,11,Fministers to consider a "final offer"
OL,12,Fof #1.5bn extra money.
OL,23,APub: 06-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG2/2
